// Cells (generated as one Ascii op). North: the cliff with the Tunnel de Verre's door (25, 3). The
// plaza (rows 4-8): the Taverne (a Pokemon Center, door (4, 7)), the rusty distributor (8, 7), the
// town sign (22, 5), the market stalls, the neon sign (34, 6), container stacks. The silica dunes
// (x 1-17, rows 10-17: sand, tall grass) with the blue container's pocket (x 3-7, rows 13-16: the
// container (6, 15) is pushed into (6, 14) to reach the Water Stone (4, 15)). The street (x 18-33),
// the container wall (x 34-35) and Crow's alley (x 36-48, rows 11-16, its mouth (40-42, 17) on the
// quay). The west containers (x 1-14, rows 18-19) with the four grunts' alcoves (13, 11, 9, 7; 19)
// over the one-tile corridor (row 20) to the cargo pier. The quays (rows 18-20), the edge (row 21).
// The cargo pier (x 2-3) and the gym pier (x 27-28) lead to docks (row 26) under the two hulls'
// boarding stairs (cargo (7, 25), Zenith-Grog (32, 25)); the gym sign (26, 20). The east jetty
// (x 40-47, rows 21-23).
// The hulls stand in a solid shoal (414, as round the Abandoned Ship on Route 108). The shallows
